    "created_at": "2026-09-29T11:55:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-09-29T11:55:47Z",
    "body": "Doesn't the \"If another occurrence of this algorithm is already running for this text track and its track element, return, letting that other algorithm take care of this element.\" ensure that changing the mode a bunch of times only has an effect once? The way I read the spec, it's equivalent to queueing a microtask together with a \"microtask was queued\" flag to avoid queueing multiple microtasks.",
